            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Cubby is now $12

Free for 14 days, then $12 once — for three Macs, forever, no subscription.

**If you were already using Cubby, nothing changes.** Everyone who installed
before 10 September 2026 keeps it permanently. No trial, no key, no prompt. You
were here while it was free and unfinished, and that stands.

Bought it? Settings → Licence, paste your key. It is checked once and then kept
on your Mac, so it keeps working with no connection and no account.

### What happens when a trial ends

Nothing is deleted, and nothing ever will be. Your history stays exactly where
it is and the panel still opens. Cubby stops pasting and stops capturing until
there is a key — and the moment you enter one, everything you collected is
there waiting.
]]></description>
